  "bio": "Stefano Fabretti is a highly skilled Italian tattoo artist renowned for his specialty in black & gray styles, particularly in realistic, horror, and bioorganic tattoos. His exemplary craftsmanship is reflected in the intricate and unique art pieces he effortlessly etches onto his client's skin, making him a notable co-owner of the renowned IV Dimensione Tattoo Studio in Italy.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\n🇮🇹 Tattoo Artist | Realistic🩸Horror 💀 Bioorganic 🧬\n🔪 work  @iv_dimensione_tattoo_studio\nInks: @dermalizepro @tattoodefender @barberdts_it",
